# 0013 - OSC 1337 multipart file transfer (MultipartFile / FilePart / FileEnd)
# Ported to upstream c3436be.
#
# Port notes vs v1.15.0:
# - osciTerm2 uses parseDimension(kv, key:) with named `key:` parameter upstream.
# - terminalBase64Decode() replaces Data(base64Encoded:) for the File= path upstream;
#   insertInlineImage uses terminalBase64Decode too.
# - The FileEnd check must come before the equalIdx guard (same as v1.15.0 port).
# - All other logic (ITermMultipartTransfer struct, watchdog, cumulative cap) is unchanged.
# - iTermMultipart and iTermMultipartWatchdogArmed use nonisolated(unsafe) to satisfy
#   Swift 6 strict concurrency (mutated from a DispatchQueue.main.asyncAfter closure).
